@startuml
!theme mars
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Pelanggan" as Cust
boundary "Customer Portal" as UI
control "Sistem" as System
database "DB Customers" as DB
participant "Xendit" as PG

== Lihat Status Langganan ==

Cust -> UI : Login ke Customer Portal
activate UI
UI -> System : POST /api/customer-portal/auth
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> System : Verifikasi token JWT

System -> DB : Ambil data subscription\n& invoice pelanggan
activate DB
DB --> System : Data langganan
deactivate DB

System -> System : Hitung status:\nAktif / Jatuh Tempo / Terisolasi

System --> UI : Data subscription & status
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> Cust : Tampilkan dashboard\nstatus langganan
deactivate UI

== Bayar Tagihan ==

Cust -> UI : Pilih invoice belum dibayar
activate UI
UI -> System : GET /api/customer-portal/invoices/unpaid
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Ambil invoice unpaid
activate DB
DB --> System : Daftar invoice
deactivate DB

System --> UI : Daftar tagihan
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> Cust : Tampilkan tagihan tertunggak
deactivate UI

Cust -> UI : Klik Bayar &\npilih metode pembayaran
activate UI
UI -> System : POST /api/customer-portal/invoices/:id/pay
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> PG : Buat payment request
activate PG
PG --> System : payment_url
deactivate PG

System -> DB : UPDATE invoices\n(status = waiting_payment)
activate DB
DB --> System : Berhasil
deactivate DB

System --> UI : payment_url
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> Cust : Redirect ke halaman\npembayaran Xendit
deactivate UI

note over PG
  Setelah pembayaran selesai,
  Xendit mengirim callback webhook
  (lihat diagram Billing)
end note

== Edit Profil Pelanggan ==

Cust -> UI : Buka halaman Profil
activate UI
UI -> System : GET /api/customer-portal/profile
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Ambil data profil
activate DB
DB --> System : Data profil
deactivate DB

System --> UI : Data profil
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> Cust : Tampilkan form profil
deactivate UI

Cust -> UI : Edit data & klik Simpan
activate UI
UI -> System : PUT /api/customer-portal/profile
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> System : Validasi perubahan data
alt Data Tidak Valid
    System --> UI : Error: Data tidak valid
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Cust : Tampilkan pesan error
    deactivate UI
else Data Valid
    System -> DB : UPDATE customers
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Berhasil
    deactivate DB

    System --> UI : 200 OK
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Cust : Profil berhasil diperbarui
    deactivate UI
end

== Lihat Riwayat Pembayaran ==

Cust -> UI : Buka menu\nRiwayat Pembayaran
activate UI
UI -> System : GET /api/customer-portal/payments
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Query riwayat transaksi\nby customer_id
activate DB
DB --> System : Riwayat transaksi
deactivate DB

System -> System : Format data\n(tanggal, nominal, status)

System --> UI : Data riwayat
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> Cust : Tampilkan daftar transaksi
deactivate UI

note right of Cust
  Customer Portal: self-service.
  Login JWT terpisah dari Admin.
  Pembayaran via Xendit.
  Akses data milik sendiri saja.
end note

@enduml
